From 07c7f071644a2c5a73ae45ffd8b6a74a698a809f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Torben Haack <t128n@ipv4.8shield.net>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 11:23:43 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] feat(chat): add GIF search and picker to chat composer

Add GIF search and a picker popover to the chat composer toolbar,
allowing users to search, preview, and send animated GIFs directly
in chat channels and direct messages via Tenor, Giphy, or custom
providers.

Closes t128n/torbit#30
